Package: intune-zabbix-bridge
Version: 0.0.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Infiltrator Projects
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), zabbix-sender, ca-certificates, zabbix-frontend-php (>= 7.0)
Homepage: https://github.com/Infiltrator-Projects/Intune-Zabbix-Bridge
Description: Microsoft Intune telemetry bridge and Zabbix reboot-watch widget
 Reads existing Microsoft Intune Windows reboot telemetry through Microsoft Graph
 and publishes fleet metrics to Zabbix. Includes the native INTUNE Reboot Watch
 dashboard widget. The Debian package is universal; deployment credentials are
 supplied in one separate intune-zabbix-bridge.env file.
